WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Enter delivery details and phone
No sign-in is needed. Choose the address and enter a valid phone. Leave
email blank if you do not use one.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Choose cash on delivery
Guests are offered cash on delivery. Read the shipping, tax and total
before reviewing the purchase. Sign in for other payment methods.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Keep the receipt; an account is optional
The purchase is already placed. Save the invoice when its PDF is
available. Phone verification is only needed to save these purchases to
an account.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The same journey in Arabic
Arabic readers see the same optional account action. Verify the purchase
phone to create a phone-only account or attach purchases to an existing
one.

